  "prefLabel": "Gen 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 403.01 Licenses Subject to Reinstatement. The following licenses shall be subject to reinstatement:\n\n(a) Licenses suspended pursuant to Plc 205 or Plc 206, or as a result of disciplinary action commenced pursuant to Gen 402.06(f), shall be eligible for reinstatement pursuant to Plc 312.04; and\n\n(b) Licenses expired for not more than one year shall be eligible for reinstatement pursuant to Plc 312.02.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14 ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
}
